  "releaseNotes": "feat(model): deprecate DbModel and transition to EF Core ecosystem\n\n      - Hide and mark DbModel as obsolete/internal in favor of EF Core integration.\n      - Focus core development on Zero-Allocation LINQ Helpers and Expression utilities.\n      - Maintain DbConnection interoperability while encouraging ORM query patterns.\n      - Reduce overall maintenance overhead for raw DB execution pipelines.",
